presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Creating A Standard Voicemail Message ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " When people call and can't reach you, they can leave a voicemail message. Here are different ways of creating your own voicemail message:", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Recording a voicemail message</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Hello, you've reached Carole Smith  with A&R company. I'm unable to take your call at the moment. Please leave your name, telephone number and a message after the beep and I will return your call as soon as possible. Thank you! </li> <li>Hello. You've reached 555-222-6789. Please leave a detailed message after the beep.</li> <li>Hi, this is Liz Deslippe. I'm sorry I'm not available to take your call at this time. Leave a message and I'll get back to you as soon as I can.</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Leaving A Standard Voicemail Message", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " When you call someone and they don't answer the telephone, you will need to leave a voicemail message. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you leave a voicemail message, you need to make sure that the person who should receive your message has all the information he or she needs. The chart below outlines all the information you need to include when leaving a voicemail message:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" 1. <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Introduction\\t\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Hello, this is Rod Ellis. OR </li> <li>Hello, My name is Rod Ellis. (slightly more formal)</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"2. <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Reason for calling</span> (you can say the time of day) \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>I am calling to let you know that I still haven't heard from you. OR </li> <li>It's ten in the morning. I'm phoning to find out if ... </li></ul> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" 3.<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Make a request </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <ul><li>Can you you give me a call back to confirm your interest in the project?</li> <li>Could ring me back?</li> <li>Would you mind calling me back?</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" 4. <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Leave your contact number</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>You can reach me at 555-825-5885. </li> <li>My number is ... </li> <li>Call me at ...</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" 5. <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Ending</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <ul><li>Thanks. Goodbye.</li> <li>Thanks a lot, bye. </li> <li>I'll talk to you later, bye. </li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Hello</span>, Maria. <span class=\"strong\">This is</span> Mark. <span class=\"strong\">I am calling to let you know that</span> I still haven't received the report. <span class=\"strong\">Can you give me a call back to</span> confirm you are sending me the reports today?<span class=\"strong\"> You can reach me at</span> 555-416-5221. <span class=\"strong\">Thanks a lot, bye.</span>", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to approach", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to ask someone to do something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We were approached by another PR company.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when leaving a voicemail message about work.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to show interest", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to want to know or learn more about something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They have shown interest in working with our clothing line.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "in relation to", "type": "name"}, {"content": " in connection with something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm phoning in relation to our proposal. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to have (something) ready ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to prepare for use", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We should have it ready by the end of the week.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "regarding", "type": "name"}, {"content": "about", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(preposition)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm hoping we could talk regarding our plans for your company.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to reach ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to speak to someone on the telephone ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can reach me tomorrow anytime after 9. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "You are setting up your voicemail. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You have to create a standard voicemail message.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write what you will include in your voicemail message.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read it aloud.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Your partner will leave a voicemail for you. Listen to your partner leave the message.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Switch roles. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I create a standard voicemail message.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I leave a voicemail message.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I listen to a friend's voicemail.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le04ob10re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le04ob10re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "</p><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Hello, you've reached Janet Allison with Polygon Public Relations Inc. I'm unable to take your call at the moment, so please leave your name, telephone number and a message after the beep and I will return your call as soon as possible. Thank you!"}, {"image": "engenn6le04ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "22000", "id": 2, "text": "</p><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Hello, Janet. This is Farmani from Holly's.  I'm calling you to let you know that I still haven't received a proposal from Polygon. I was approached um, approached by another company who has shown interest in working with our new clothing line. Anyways, can you give me a call back to confirm that you are still interested? You can reach me at 555-825-5885. I'll be in the office until 5 o'clock. Thanks. Goodbye."}, {"image": "engenn6le04ob10re2img07.jpg", "time": "50000", "id": 3, "text": "</p><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Hello, you've reached Farmani. I'm afraid I'm not available to take your call right now, but if you leave a message with your name and number, I'll get back to you as soon as I can.\n</p><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Hello, Mr. Farmani. This is Janet with Polygon Public Relations. I'm phoning in regards to our proposal. We have been working on it and should have it ready by the end of the week. I'm hoping that we could talk at some point regarding our plans for your company. You can reach me tomorrow anytime between 9 and noon at 555-390-0330. Thanks."}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le04ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le04ob10re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "  I can talk about jobs and work. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can leave a voicemail message. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can create a standard voicemail message. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Have you ever heard of the expression <span class=\"italic\">phone tag</span>? What do you think it means?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Have you ever played phone tag with someone? What happened?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowe